## Letter from the CEO

Dear Stakeholders,

Fiscal Year 2023 marked our transition from a promising startup to a market leader in healthcare interoperability. We achieved revenue of $89.5 million, representing 85.7% year-over-year growth, while significantly improving our path to profitability.

Our expansion into the European market through our London and Berlin offices has exceeded expectations, with EMEA now representing 19% of total revenue. The launch of MedSync Analytics in Q4 2022 has been particularly well-received, contributing $7.2M in its first full year.

Key highlights from FY 2023 include:

- **Revenue growth of 85.7%** to $89.5M (from $48.2M in FY 2022)
- **Improved EBITDA** to ($8.2M) from ($18.5M) in FY 2022
- **Customer base growth** from 285 to 412 customers
- **Team expansion** to 820 employees across 4 offices
- **International revenue** now 25% of total

Looking ahead to FY 2024, we are targeting continued strong growth while achieving our first profitable quarter.

Dr. Elena Rodriguez
Chief Executive Officer & Co-Founder

